<item>
<title>我最近发现一个挺有意思的开源项目，叫 LinPad OS。简单来说，就是给 iPad 装上一套 Linux 桌面环境。有</title>
<link>https://t.me/weekly_books/2602</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/weekly_books/2602</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:59:19 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>我最近发现一个挺有意思的开源项目，叫 LinPad OS。简单来说，就是给 iPad 装上一套 Linux 桌面环境。<br/><br/>有完整的电脑桌面，能开多个窗口，能用 VS Code、Python、Node.js、Git，甚至还能在终端里跑 Claude Code。<br/><br/>最让我心动的是，这些东西都能在 iPad 本地运行。不用远程连接 Mac，也不用专门折腾一台 VPS。<br/><br/>想想还挺美的。早上带着 iPad 去咖啡馆，接上键盘，打开 Claude Code，让 AI 帮忙改改网站、写写代码。改完直接预览，没问题就推送到 GitHub。<br/><br/>突然有个新点子，还能顺手做个小产品。忙完了，切回 iPadOS，看看书，写写笔记，刷刷网页。一台设备，基本把我出门要干的事都包圆了。<i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png')"><b>🏄</b></i><br/><br/>现在想想，或许你并不真的需要一部 iPhone Duo。与其花大价钱买个能展开的手机，我倒更想要一台能随时干活的 iPad。<br/><br/>项目地址：<a href="https://linpados.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://linpados.com</a></div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8F84.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/bjsNxCxHhUJDsHMem5CusVK63bdDlSzITDzf3jb-3TGj83nyXVI7uRI5dT1Rk1RFLI5CMXq8La-Mk3PaFcNEhi6gFJk3s-qlVA9RWopbfMDcDGgZ1H934TLRIQ7qnOA_j-QJyGxTnqNWW02_kdqGzCPdk4c8jvEgb8j_qCyHJ1PGEoe8D5ngi3Rn6-ZeMWlcGln4ev-zSnnzsTUO0Cgqft8Wn_bQGRklKufAw9UzmdEkDH0p4v5BzeUZmHoSmCHiazxsjIl1xDu4TfHXeVuugQM-4UQEpKnNWDoNqeLbNUgDMLJZurvSSwkry3cCCDd4FgqxhY1LpFI8B90bQ9doWQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AF.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><blockquote style='border-left:3px solid #ccc;padding-left:8px;'><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/bjsNxCxHhUJDsHMem5CusVK63bdDlSzITDzf3jb-3TGj83nyXVI7uRI5dT1Rk1RFLI5CMXq8La-Mk3PaFcNEhi6gFJk3s-qlVA9RWopbfMDcDGgZ1H934TLRIQ7qnOA_j-QJyGxTnqNWW02_kdqGzCPdk4c8jvEgb8j_qCyHJ1PGEoe8D5ngi3Rn6-ZeMWlcGln4ev-zSnnzsTUO0Cgqft8Wn_bQGRklKufAw9UzmdEkDH0p4v5BzeUZmHoSmCHiazxsjIl1xDu4TfHXeVuugQM-4UQEpKnNWDoNqeLbNUgDMLJZurvSSwkry3cCCDd4FgqxhY1LpFI8B90bQ9doWQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"><br><b><a href="https://linpados.com/">LinPad OS — Linux for iPad, Desktop Apps &amp;amp; Terminal</a></b><br><small>LinPad OS</small><br>LinPad OS brings a free, open-source Alpine Linux desktop to your iPad. Run VS Code, Firefox and a local terminal, with keyboard and touch support.</blockquote></p>]]></description>
